<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i>Hi&nbsp;</i>{{{Quote.Freight_Contact_Name__c}}}<br />
<br />
<i><span style="color:black">Thank you for requesting a quote from Qantas Freight. We have reviewed the information provided and are pleased to provide you with the attached quote. &nbsp;</span></i><br />
<br />
<i>If this quote is suitable, please follow the below steps to have your rate confirmed and applied:</i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b><i>For Spot Rates:</i></b></span></span>
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i><span style="color:black">To make a booking for </span>shipments please phone on (09) 256 6356 or email </i><a href="mailto:aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><i>aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au</i></a></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i><span style="color:black">Within 24hrs / prior to shipment departure, please email a copy of this quote and advise the Airway Bill (AWB) number on your booking to </span></i><a href="mailto:aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><i>aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au</i></a></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:11px;"> <span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> <b><i><span style="color:black">Note:</span></i></b><i><span style="color:black"> Above is important to ensure the Spot Rate is applied. Credits<b> cannot</b> be issued if this process is not followed.</span></i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b><i><span style="color:black">For Preferred Rates:</span></i></b></span></span>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i><span style="color:black">Please advise acceptance of these rates by return email within 7 days</span></i></span></span></li>
</ul>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><i><span style="color:black">Upon acceptance of these rates your account manager will advise the rates effective date (will either be 1<sup>st</sup> or 15<sup>th</sup> of the month)</span></i></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:11px;"> <span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> <b><i><span style="color:black">Note:</span></i></b><i><span style="color:black"> Preferred rates will not be valid in the system unless the above steps are completed</span></i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b><i><span style="color:black">For International Quotes: </span></i></b><i><span style="color:black">Pricing quoted is all inclusive of surcharges</span><span style="color:#1f497d">.</span></i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<i><span style="color:black">If we can assist with any further information, please contact our Auckland Freight Team </span>on (09) 256 6356 <span style="color:black">or </span></i><a href="mailto:aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><i>aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au</i></a><br />
<br />
{{{Sender.Name}}}</span></span></body>
</html>